section.environment-commitments(class="relative pb-10 z-2 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,251,240,_0.00)_0%,#FFFBF0_43.9%)]")
    .container
        .section-wrapper(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6 -mt-48")
            .section-heading
                h2.heading
                    .text(class="heading-1-subpage text-primary-4 text-center font-bold")
                        | OUR COMMITMENTS

            .section-desc
                p.desc
                    .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 font-primary")
                        | At Bel Ga Asia, sustainability is an integral part of the way we operate. As a trusted provider of premium-quality day-old chicks (DOC) and day-old layers (DOL), we are committed to responsible breeding practices that protect the environment, support our people and communities, uphold the highest standards of governance, and create sustainable value for future generations.

            .section-content
                .grid
                    -for(i=0;i<4;i++)
                        .item-container
                            .item-content(class="flex-center flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5 w-full h-full")
                                .item-img(class="w-[34.48%]")
                                    .img(class="img-ratio aspect-square")
                                        +PugImg()

                                .item-text(class="flex-center flex-col flex-1 gap-3")
                                    .text-title
                                        h3.title
                                            .text(class="heading-4 text-primary-1 font-bold")
                                                | Environmental Stewardship

                                    .text-desc(class="flex-1")
                                        p.desc
                                            .text(class="body-2 text-Utility-gray-950 text-justify")
                                                | We are committed to delivering consistent superior quality Day Old Chicks and Day Old Layers across Asia.